["I need to make 24 using 10, 4, 9, 7, each number once, using +, -, *, /.\n\nLet me try different combinations.\n\nNumbers: 10, 4, 9, 7\n\nLet me think...\n\n(10 - 7) * 4 + 9 = 3 * 4 + 9 = 12 + 9 = 21. No.\n\n10 + 9 + 7 - 4 = 22. No.\n\n10 + 9 + 7 + 4 = 30. No.\n\n(10 - 7) * 9 - 4 = 27 - 4 = 23. No.\n\n(10 - 7) * 9 + 4 = 27 + 4 = 31. No.\n\n9 * 4 - 10 - 7 = 36 - 17 = 19. No.\n\n9 * 4 - 10 + 7 = 36 - 3 = 33. No.\n\n9 * 4 + 10 - 7 = 36 + 3 = 39. No.\n\n10 * 4 - 9 - 7 = 40 - 16 = 24. Yes!\n\n10 * 4 - 9 - 7 = 40 - 16 = 24. \n\nLet me verify: 10 * 4 = 40, 40 - 9 = 31, 31 - 7 = 24. Yes!\n\nSo the answer is 10 * 4 - 9 - 7.\n"]